# Hepsiburada Automation

## Full Flow
* open chrome
* go to hepsiburada
* hover user info
* click login
//  !!!!! env/default/credentials.properties for username and password
* enter username from config
* enter password from config
* click login submit
* verify user is logged in
* search for "bilgisayar"
* open second row first product
* add product to cart from detail page
* open cart from header
* verify product name is visible in cart
* verify product basic details in cart

